Vnum            10101
Name            orgrimmar guard~
ShortDesc       奧格瑞瑪守衛~
LongDesc        一名奧格瑞瑪守衛(orgrimmar guard)正在巡邏。
~
Description
全副武裝的奧格瑞瑪守衛﹐身著厚重的鍛鐵盔甲﹐手持強力戰斧
。獸人天生的戰鬥本能讓他們成為可怕的敵人。
~
Sentinel        Yes
StayArea        Yes
AutoSetValue    Yes
Effect          'detect invis'
Effect          'detect hidden'
Effect          'sanctuary'
Alignment       -200
Level           30
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             -1
Int             -1
Wis             -1
Dex             -1
Con             -1
Hp              -1
Mana            -1
Move            -1
Class           CLASS_FIGHTER
Gold            -1
Multipile       100
AttackRatio     100
DodgeRatio      100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_MALE

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          100
Text
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimmort($n)
  break
endif
if isenemy($n) != '奧格瑞瑪'
  mpsetenemy $n '奧格瑞瑪'
endif
~
End

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          30
Text
if rand(30)
  emote 威嚴地巡邏著…
  say 陌生人！別惹麻煩！
endif
~
End

End